						"description": "Gets specs for PAPI deployment. The first spec in the response (most recent) contains the spec ID needed for logs.\n\n**Deployment ID:** 1750fc69-329f-4e85-95cb-8659ab957e6e (PAPI)\n\n**Response:** Array of specs, each with a `version` field (this is the spec ID).\n\n**Use the first spec's `version` field as the spec ID for logs.**"
