						"description": "Retrieves logs for the PAPI deployment using the correct CloudHub 2.0 endpoint.\n\n**Deployment ID:** 1750fc69-329f-4e85-95cb-8659ab957e6e (PAPI)\n**Spec ID:** 9e3e5aba-91df-426a-9ac0-0c1ce9739078 (from Get PAPI Specs)\n**Endpoint:** /organizations/{orgId}/environments/{envId}/deployments/{deploymentId}/specs/{specId}/logs\n\n**Query Parameters:**\n- `startTime`: Start time in milliseconds (timestamp) - optional\n- `endTime`: End time in milliseconds (timestamp) - optional\n- `descending`: Sort order (false = ascending, true = descending)\n- `afterDocId`: Pagination cursor from previous response - optional\n\n**Note:** First get the spec ID using 'Get PAPI Specs', then use the first spec's `version` field as the spec ID."
					},
